## The Purpose

This platform was built by one person, from nothing, to do something real for people who have been left behind by financial systems, economic inequality, and the failures of the past several years. It is offered to the world — not to extract value from it.

The Solidarity Platform exists to:
- Reduce payment fees for small businesses, nonprofits, independent workers, and governments operating in underserved communities
- Give people access to financial tools that were previously only available to institutions
- Demonstrate that mathematical fairness (φ-ratio optimization) can be embedded into software and used to benefit people at scale
- Provide privacy-first, locally-run AI so that anyone — regardless of income — can access intelligent tooling without ongoing API costs

